      "title": "BabyBliss Bamboo Fiber Baby Bowl - BPA-Free Cartoon Animal Plates",
      "body_html": "<h2>BabyBliss Kids Baby Natural Bamboo Fiber Bowl - Safe &amp; Fun Feeding Solution</h2>\n<p>Make mealtime fun, safe, and eco-friendly with the <strong>Kids Baby Natural Bamboo Fiber Bowl</strong>. Crafted from <strong>natural, BPA-free bamboo fiber</strong>, these lightweight and durable bowls are designed for babies, toddlers, and young children.</p>\n<p>Featuring <strong>cute cartoon animal designs</strong>, they encourage kids to enjoy healthy meals while making feeding time more exciting. Perfectly sized for small hands, these bowls are easy to grip and safe for everyday use.</p>\n<p>Ideal for <strong>home, daycare, or travel</strong>, the bowls are <strong>non-toxic, portable, and reusable</strong>, giving parents peace of mind while caring for their child's health and the environment.</p>\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Made from <strong>natural bamboo fiber, eco-friendly &amp; BPA-free</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Lightweight, durable &amp; safe for babies and toddlers</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Cute <strong>cartoon animal designs</strong> for fun mealtimes</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Easy to grip &amp; perfectly sized for little hands</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Portable, reusable &amp; ideal for home or travel</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>A must-have <strong>baby feeding tableware</strong> set that combines safety, fun, and sustainability for your child's daily meals.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"BabyBliss Kids Baby Bamboo Fiber Bowl\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0886/4910/5750/files/622524312881.jpg?v=1756646361\"><img alt=\"BabyBliss Kids Baby Bamboo Fiber Bowl\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0886/4910/5750/files/186084055253.jpg?v=1756646356\"><br></p>",
