      "id": 9861049876822,
      "title": "Bamboo Fiber Kids Tableware Set - 5pc Grid Plate Bowl Cup Utensils",
      "body_html": "<h2>Bamboo Fiber Children's Tableware Set</h2>\n<p>The 3Taste Children's Bamboo Fiber Tableware Set delivers a complete mealtime solution for young children. This 5-piece set includes a grid plate, cartoon bowl, cup, spoon, and fork—everything needed for independent eating at home or kindergarten.</p>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0886/4910/5750/files/1620462725308.jpg?v=1759421078\" alt=\"3Taste Children's Bamboo Fiber Tableware Set – Kindergarten Grid Plate with Cartoon Bowl, Spoon, Fork, and Cup | Essential Eco-Friendly Eating Set for Kids\" style=\"float: none;\"></div>\n\n<h2>Smart Design Features</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Grid plate design helps portion meals and keeps foods separated</li>\n<li>Cartoon-themed bowl, cup, and utensils make mealtime fun and engaging</li>\n<li>Lightweight bamboo fiber construction is safe, durable, and eco-friendly</li>\n<li>Smooth edges and child-sized design ensure comfort and safety</li>\n<li>Dishwasher-safe for easy cleaning and daily convenience</li>\n<li>Complete set includes everything needed for a child's meal</li>\n</ul>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0886/4910/5750/files/1620462725281.jpg?v=1759421078\" alt=\"3Taste Children's Bamboo Fiber Tableware Set – Kindergarten Grid Plate with Cartoon Bowl, Spoon, Fork, and Cup | Essential Eco-Friendly Eating Set for Kids\" style=\"float: none;\"></div>\n\n<h2>Setup and Usage</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Wash all pieces thoroughly before first use</li>\n<li>Use the grid plate for balanced meals and food separation</li>\n<li>Encourage your child to use the spoon and fork for self-feeding practice</li>\n<li>The matching cup and bowl complete a child-friendly mealtime set</li>\n<li>Rinse or machine wash after meals for quick and easy cleanup</li>\n</ul>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0886/4910/5750/files/1620462770618.jpg?v=1759421076\" alt=\"3Taste Children's Bamboo Fiber Tableware Set – Kindergarten Grid Plate with Cartoon Bowl, Spoon, Fork, and Cup | Essential Eco-Friendly Eating Set for Kids\" style=\"float: none;\"></div>\n\n<h2>Product Specifications</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: Eco-friendly bamboo fiber, BPA-free and food-grade safe</li>\n<li>Dimensions: Child-sized plate, bowl, cup, spoon, and fork</li>\n<li>Style: Cartoon-themed design with grid plate and matching accessories</li>\n<li>Colors: Available in playful patterns and pastel shades</li>\n<li>Suitable for: Children in kindergarten or at home during daily meals</li>\n<li>Package: 1 grid plate + 1 bowl + 1 cup + 1 spoon + 1 fork</li>\n</ul>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0886/4910/5750/files/1620462725308.jpg?v=1759421078\" alt=\"3Taste Children's Bamboo Fiber Tableware Set – Kindergarten Grid Plate with Cartoon Bowl, Spoon, Fork, and Cup | Essential Eco-Friendly Eating Set for Kids\" style=\"float: none;\"></div>\n\n<h2>Why Choose 3Taste Tableware</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Eco-friendly bamboo fiber construction, safer and more sustainable than plastic</li>\n<li>Fun cartoon designs encourage kids to enjoy eating independently</li>\n<li>Lightweight and durable, perfect for everyday use at home or school</li>\n<li>Grid plate design supports balanced and varied meals</li>\n<li>Easy to clean and maintain, saving parents time after meals</li>\n<li>A complete, practical, and eco-conscious solution for modern families</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\" class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>A Nestacular Promise</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\" class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>At Nestacular, we believe in the quality of our products, so we offer a 30-day Money-Back Guarantee, no questions asked! When you purchase from us, there is ZERO Risk for you!</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\" class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Congratulations!</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\" class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>You've found a hidden discount code! Use code \"TTD\" at checkout to claim an additional 10% OFF your ENTIRE order!</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\" class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Customer Support:</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\" class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Email: support@nestacular.com</strong></span></p>",
