    {
      "id": 9791666094422,
      "title": "BubblyJoy Bamboo Baby Bowl Set - Non-Toxic Toddler Feeding Kit",
      "body_html": "<h2>BubblyJoy Baby &amp; Toddler Bamboo Bowl Set – Complete Feeding Solution</h2>\n<p data-start=\"118\" data-end=\"369\">Make mealtime eco-friendly and fun with the <strong data-start=\"193\" data-end=\"237\">BubblyJoy Baby &amp; Toddler Bamboo Bowl Set</strong>. This complete feeding set includes a <strong data-start=\"276\" data-end=\"311\">bamboo bowl, spoon, and cutlery</strong>, perfect for babies and toddlers learning to self-feed.</p>\n<p data-start=\"371\" data-end=\"673\">Crafted from <strong data-start=\"384\" data-end=\"413\">durable, non-toxic bamboo</strong>, the set is <strong data-start=\"426\" data-end=\"477\">safe, lightweight, and environmentally friendly</strong>. The smooth, rounded edges are gentle on little mouths, while the sturdy design ensures long-lasting use. Ideal for home, daycare, or travel, this set makes mealtimes stress-free and enjoyable.</p>\n<p data-start=\"675\" data-end=\"694\"><strong data-start=\"675\" data-end=\"692\">Key Features:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"695\" data-end=\"1047\">\n<li data-start=\"695\" data-end=\"766\">\n<p data-start=\"697\" data-end=\"766\"><strong data-start=\"697\" data-end=\"721\">Eco-Friendly Bamboo:</strong> Safe, non-toxic, and sustainable material.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"767\" data-end=\"844\">\n<p data-start=\"769\" data-end=\"844\"><strong data-start=\"769\" data-end=\"794\">Complete Feeding Set:</strong> Includes bowl, spoon, and cutlery for toddlers.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"845\" data-end=\"915\">\n<p data-start=\"847\" data-end=\"915\"><strong data-start=\"847\" data-end=\"872\">Gentle &amp; Safe Design:</strong> Smooth edges suitable for little mouths.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"916\" data-end=\"979\">\n<p data-start=\"918\" data-end=\"979\"><strong data-start=\"918\" data-end=\"944\">Lightweight &amp; Durable:</strong> Perfect for home and travel use.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"980\" data-end=\"1047\">\n<p data-start=\"982\" data-end=\"1047\"><strong data-start=\"982\" data-end=\"1010\">Encourages Self-Feeding:</strong> Helps toddlers learn independence.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1049\" data-end=\"1190\">Enjoy sustainable and convenient mealtime with the <strong data-start=\"1100\" data-end=\"1144\">BubblyJoy Baby &amp; Toddler Bamboo Bowl Set</strong> – practical, safe, and fun for little ones.<br></p>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0886/4910/5750/files/1618990870782.jpg?v=1756905207\" alt=\"BubblyJoy Baby &amp; Toddler Bamboo Bowl Set\" style=\"float: none;\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0886/4910/5750/files/1618990870813.jpg?v=1756905207\" alt=\"BubblyJoy Baby &amp; Toddler Bamboo Bowl Set\" style=\"float: none;\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0886/4910/5750/files/1618990870816.jpg?v=1756905207\" alt=\"BubblyJoy Baby &amp; Toddler Bamboo Bowl Set\" style=\"float: none;\"></div>",
